{"id":"f62d5e20-3f16-42cd-aa3e-8e691d4ef1e2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"e69d9b95acdc2a61","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/evidence.ts","baseline":{"blob":"886a23b5d4a324650db56e77f6543254758ee8b5","start":3537,"end":3637},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","EvidenceIntake","{","\"","times","\"",":","(","runId",":","string",",","file",":","string",",","times",":","FileTimes",")","=>","void","}"]},"context":{"before":"62729a4d79957aa1","after":"88d828d6d5262aeb"}},"payload":{"text":"What evidence takes from elsewhere in the workbench: a profile's times, of a file (a workspace path), taken in a run.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:23:02.363Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:23:02.363Z"}
{"id":"f63f4057-29a4-4872-a362-c2868e9993c2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"536e16634128dc57","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/evidence.ts","baseline":{"blob":"0c34bec971d8cd294cf1e75d46d7d2cd7d643974","start":0,"end":107},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Effect",",","LoadedPackage",",","SiteObservation",",","StatementCoverage","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api","\""]},"context":{"after":"5aad35322beffa7a"}},"payload":{"text":"What running your program teaches the editor, kept in git (RUNTIME-EVIDENCE.md): when a run ends, its envelope — whose\nrun, where it ran, on what code — is appended to `.silo/runs/<user>.jsonl`, and what it observed is folded into\n`.silo/evidence/<user>/<environment>/<file>.jsonl`, keyed on BABLR spans. silo decides the shape, the layout and how\nevidence fades (@brianjenkins94/util/silo/evidence); this gathers the facts only the editor has: the run (runs.ts), the\nbrowser it ran in, the repository it ran on, and what the runtime saw — a debug session's report as it ends\n(`evidence.observed`, the bridge's, from tsval's `coverage`): each statement's count under the span BABLR picks for it,\nand what went through each observed site (values at `?.`, `??`, parameters and returns; each branch's arms) under the\nspan that's exactly its node — a site without one isn't recorded. Its capability calls, each with how it was decided\n(`evidence.effects`), go in its envelope: an answer given at a call is an exception to the policy, on record there. The\nvalues themselves stay on this machine\n(`.silo/local/samples/`). A file BABLR's grammar doesn't take yet gets no evidence; its run is still recorded, saying so.\n\nAnd where a preview's time went, each time it's profiled (profile-times.ts gives each function's time): folded into the\nfile's evidence as it's taken, on the function's span (silo's foldTimes), marked with the run it was taken in, so it's on\nthe code at once rather than when the run ends. Each profile is one in the fading.\n\nA live run isn't a run here: it's the editor's, as you type, and would write on every pause.\n\nRuns in the workbench realm; writes through VS Code's file system, so an open runs file shows each new line.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:23:28.257Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:23:28.257Z"}
{"id":"fc530f40-77fc-43e9-a96a-0ad63033a957","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6e83ec7f39313cb8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/evidence.ts","baseline":{"blob":"b2a3b0a588f03df5156857e896e694169d1d849b","start":10176,"end":10221},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","reports","=","new","Map","<","string",",","Coverage","[]",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"7ecaf89364387ca1","after":"3e646f20205be8d7"}},"payload":{"text":"Each run's report, until the run ends (the session's coverage comes just before its end): its entry's, and each other\nof the program's files that ran (packages/tsval/README.md, *Modules*); and the packages whose code it ran.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:21:57.990Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:21:57.990Z"}
{"id":"fd2af3b4-ecab-4fc0-9998-9fd01c57f11e","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"62729a4d79957aa1","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/evidence.ts","baseline":{"blob":"40c4d193bdaf765271e813fe9a9ca74b82dc3fda","start":3328,"end":3426},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","FileTimes","{","\"","source","\"",":","string",";","\"","profiledMs","\"",":","number",";","\"","functions","\"",":","FunctionTime","[]","}"]},"context":{"before":"2e87823bf3126eba","after":"e69d9b95acdc2a61"}},"payload":{"text":"A profile of one file: the source it was read against, how long it sampled, and each function's time.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:23:08.933Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:23:08.933Z"}
